ice-of-oil-08-03-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-3.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 10:50:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-03-2026/</guid></item><item><title>Cloudflare刚刚推出了用于AI购物的永久ID工具和钱包</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/cloudflare-ai-agents-wallets-id/</link><description>这项新服务使消费者可以更轻松地为人工智能代理配备工具，让他们可以消费并向商家代理证明自己的身份。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2259521299.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/cloudflare-ai-agents-wallets-id/</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 的股票价值已缩水一半。埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 是时候面对投资者了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/spacex-earnings-musk-stock-lockup-losses/</link><description>随着亏损超过 2025 年全年，且股票禁售期即将到期，SpaceX 发布了首份公开财报。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26210651212756_d5fe07.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:47:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/spacex-earnings-musk-stock-lockup-losses/</guid></item><item><title>索托马约尔维持针对巴勒斯坦解放组织 6.56 亿美元恐怖袭击的判决</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/sotomayor-plo-656-million-terror-judgment-supreme-court-palestine/</link><description>巴勒斯坦权力机构警告称，付款可能会“破坏”西岸服务的稳定；该判决源自造成 33 人死亡的耶路撒冷袭击事件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2059260720-e1785847472655.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:45:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/sotomayor-plo-656-million-terror-judgment-supreme-court-palestine/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普称自己的住房法案是“打哈欠”。现在他正前往西海岸巡演，对经济的支持率为32%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/trump-yawn-housing-bill-economy-tour-newsom/</link><description>当特朗普在洛杉矶和拉斯维加斯兜售减税政策时，纽瑟姆对 7.25 美元的联邦最低工资进行了反击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26214761553954.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:33:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/trump-yawn-housing-bill-economy-tour-newsom/</guid></item><item><title>你的人工智能策略不会因为糟糕的设计而失败。这是因为你的团队不相信你</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/ai-strategy-belief-gap-leadership/</link><description>大多数领导者将人工智能阻力诊断为沟通问题。这是一个信念问题——解决这个问题需要了解信念实际上是如何形成的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/owen.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/ai-strategy-belief-gap-leadership/</guid></item><item><title>由于汽油价格下跌，麦当劳美国销售额增长放缓至 0.8%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/mcdonalds-us-sales-growth-new-chief-gas-prices/</link><description>在其 Minecraft 餐点推动销售额增长 2.5% 一年后，麦当劳在谨慎的消费者放缓背景下任命了一位新的美国首席执行官， &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26215559268209-e1785846525424.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:28:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/mcdonalds-us-sales-growth-new-chief-gas-prices/</guid></item></channel></rss>